{"tool_name":"cellpose","contents":["neubias","oeb","bioschemas","biotools"],"fetched_metadata":{"biotools":{"id":"cellpose","home":"http://www.cellpose.org","license":"BSD-3-Clause","summary":"Cellpose is a generalist algorithm for cellular segmentation.","addition_date":"2021-01-18T07:35:18Z","last_update_date":"2021-02-10T20:17:03Z","tool_type":["Library","Web application"],"biotools_curie":"biotools:cellpose","credit":[{"email":"pachitarium@janelia.hhmi.org","name":"Marius Pachitariu","typeEntity":"Person"},{"email":"stringerc@janelia.hhmi.org","name":"Carsen Stringer","typeEntity":"Person"}],"documentation":[{"type":["User manual"],"url":"https://cellpose.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"}],"edit_permission":{"type":"private"},"function":[{"operation":[{"term":"Microscope image visualisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3552"},{"term":"Neurite measurement","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3450"},{"term":"Standardisation and normalisation","uri":"http://edamontology.org/operation_3435"}]}],"name":"Cellpose","owner":"Kigaard","publication":[{"doi":"10.1101/2020.02.02.931238"}],"topic":[{"term":"Cell biology","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_2229"},{"term":"Imaging","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3382"},{"term":"Machine learning","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_3474"},{"term":"Transcription factors and regulatory sites","uri":"http://edamontology.org/topic_0749"}]},"bioschemas":{"name":"Cellpose","home":"https://bio.tools/cellpose","license":"BSD-3-Clause","summary":"Cellpose is a generalist algorithm for cellular segmentation.","tool_type":"sc:SoftwareApplication"},"oeb":{"metrics":[{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:cellpose/lib/www.cellpose.org","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"sourcecode":{"interpreted":true,"repository":{}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"documentation":{"manual":true},"license":{"open_source":true,"osi":true},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":0,"citations":[],"doi":"10.1101/2020.02.02.931238","ref_count":0,"refs":[]}]}],"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":false,"copyright":false,"https":false,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":null,"ssl_err":null}}},{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/biotools:cellpose/web/www.cellpose.org","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":"biotools","@type":"metrics","deprecated":true,"distribution":{"sourcecode":{"interpreted":true,"repository":{}}},"project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"documentation":{"manual":true},"license":{"open_source":true,"osi":true},"publications":[{"entries":[{"cit_count":0,"citations":[],"doi":"10.1101/2020.02.02.931238","ref_count":0,"refs":[]}]}],"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":false,"copyright":false,"https":false,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":null,"ssl_err":null}}},{"@id":"https://openebench.bsc.es/monitor/metrics/cellpose","@license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/","@nmsp":null,"@type":"metrics","project":{"build":{},"deployment":{},"publications":[],"summary":{"description":true},"website":{"bioschemas":false,"copyright":false,"https":false,"license":false,"operational":200,"ssl":null,"ssl_err":null}}}]},"neubias":{"body":[{"format":"full_html","processed":"<h2>Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Deep learning-based segmentation of cells, both fluorescence, and bright-field images (\"a generalist algorithm for cellular segmentation\"). The tool can be used either online or local or via notebooks (e.g. <a href=\"https://github.com/HenriquesLab/ZeroCostDL4Mic\">ZeroCostDL4Mic</a>).</p>\n\n<h2>How to use it</h2>\n\n<p>cellpose can be used online via ready-to-use Jyupyter notebooks with very good documentation. These notebooks are listed <a href=\"https://github.com/MouseLand/cellpose#run-cellpose-without-local-python-installation\">here</a>.</p>\n\n<h2>Local Installation</h2>\n\n<p>The general local installation procedure can be <a href=\"https://github.com/MouseLand/cellpose#local-installation\">found here</a>.</p>\n\n<p>... Installing to Silicon Mac (M1 processor) needs some tricks, and as of October 2021, the following sequence of commands works. numba should be conda-installed before pip-installing the cellpose.</p>\n\n<p><br>\n<code>conda create --name cellpose python=3.8<br>\nconda activate cellpose<br>\nconda install numba<br>\ngit clone https://github.com/MouseLand/cellpose.git<br>\ncd cellpose<br>\npip install -e . </code></p>\n","summary":"","value":"<h2>Summary</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>Deep learning-based segmentation of cells, both fluorescence, and bright-field images (\"a generalist algorithm for cellular segmentation\"). The tool can be used either online or local or via notebooks (e.g. <a href=\"https://github.com/HenriquesLab/ZeroCostDL4Mic\">ZeroCostDL4Mic</a>).</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>How to use it</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>cellpose can be used online via ready-to-use Jyupyter notebooks with very good documentation. These notebooks are listed <a href=\"https://github.com/MouseLand/cellpose#run-cellpose-without-local-python-installation\">here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<h2>Local Installation</h2>\r\n\r\n<p>The general local installation procedure can be <a href=\"https://github.com/MouseLand/cellpose#local-installation\">found here</a>.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>... Installing to Silicon Mac (M1 processor) needs some tricks, and as of October 2021, the following sequence of commands works. numba should be conda-installed before pip-installing the cellpose.</p>\r\n\r\n<p><br />\r\n<code>conda create --name cellpose python=3.8<br />\r\nconda activate cellpose<br />\r\nconda install numba<br />\r\ngit clone https://github.com/MouseLand/cellpose.git<br />\r\ncd cellpose<br />\r\npip install -e . </code></p>\r\n"}],"changed":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2021-10-18T04:09:55+00:00"}],"created":[{"format":"Y-m-d\\TH:i:sP","value":"2020-03-03T14:19:48+00:00"}],"default_langcode":[{"value":true}],"attribution_instructions":[],"comments_2023":[],"free_tagging":[],"give_feedback_on_this_soft":[{"cid":0,"comment_count":0,"last_comment_name":null,"last_comment_timestamp":1583245232,"last_comment_uid":1,"status":2}],"has_author":[{"value":"Carsen Stringer"},{"value":"Marius Pachitariu"}],"has_biological_terms":[],"has_comparison":[],"has_documentation":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"https://cellpose.readthedocs.io/en/latest/"}],"has_doi":[],"has_entry_curator":[{"target_id":94,"target_type":"user","target_uuid":"aa749c9e-5b9a-4fdf-83ce-6b94538fe57c","url":"/user/94"}],"has_function":[{"target_id":4083,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"http://edamontology.org/operation_Cell_segmentation","url":"/cell-segmentation"}],"has_implementation":[{"target_id":4339,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"f1c052f1-81ff-4315-986e-e5eef75cb95c","url":"/taxonomy/term/4339"},{"target_id":4340,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"6077b127-35d6-45a8-ac32-b321e9bd18f2","url":"/taxonomy/term/4340"},{"target_id":4341,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"4e110085-0702-47e5-85ef-0e06e082eb70","url":"/taxonomy/term/4341"},{"target_id":4342,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"3cae1836-a78b-412d-b262-604329617f2b","url":"/taxonomy/term/4342"}],"has_interaction_level":[],"has_license":[{"value":"BSD 3-Clause \"New\" or \"Revised\" License"}],"has_location":[{"options":[],"title":"Github ","uri":"https://github.com/mouseland/cellpose"}],"has_programming_language":[{"target_id":3592,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"85d4200d-894f-4d4e-b6f2-e6dd3282d534","url":"/taxonomy/term/3592"}],"has_reference_publication":[{"options":[],"title":"bioarxiv","uri":"https://www.biorxiv.org/content/10.1101/2020.02.02.931238v1"},{"options":[],"title":"Stringer, C., Wang, T., Michaelos, M. et al. Cellpose: a generalist algorithm for cellular segmentation. Nat Methods 18, 100\u2013106 (2021).","uri":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41592-020-01018-x"}],"has_usage_example":[{"options":[],"title":"","uri":"http://www.cellpose.org"},{"options":[],"title":"ZeroCostDL4Mic notebook","uri":"https://github.com/HenriquesLab/ZeroCostDL4Mic/blob/master/Colab_notebooks/Beta%20notebooks/Cellpose_2D_ZeroCostDL4Mic.ipynb"}],"image":[{"alt":"","height":550,"target_id":1536,"target_type":"file","target_uuid":"605beb20-9019-4a83-8c35-46dbb3154870","title":"","url":"http://biii.eu/sites/default/files/2021-10/CellPoseBiii.png","width":718}],"is_compatible_with":[],"is_covered_by_training_mat":[],"is_dependent_of":[{"target_id":1312,"target_type":"node","target_uuid":"ab781ca3-2495-4c2e-9a01-3942f1eccaa3","url":"/python"}],"license_openness":[{"target_id":3575,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"06a4d439-36c4-4f19-9b3a-95f50a53da20","url":"/taxonomy/term/3575"}],"platform":[{"target_id":32,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"e5fa2325-a315-46a2-a7e6-85f5ffda2ddd","url":"/taxonomy/term/32"},{"target_id":29,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"11021caa-a45d-4287-a01d-dc148498e120","url":"/taxonomy/term/29"},{"target_id":31,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"68f9790f-8330-48f4-9404-4ad5c9a7de5d","url":"/taxonomy/term/31"}],"supported_image_dimension":[{"target_id":3561,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"92973a3c-32a3-4d2b-b290-62bd0d78a3fb","url":"/taxonomy/term/3561"},{"target_id":3562,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"20313d78-9a2a-4c67-9a1b-74ef51a5525d","url":"/taxonomy/term/3562"}],"type":[{"target_id":8,"target_type":"taxonomy_term","target_uuid":"e4860247-2929-4f76-9bfb-6f1a95391204","url":"/taxonomy/term/8"}],"workflow_steps":[],"title":[{"value":"cellpose"}]}}}